            <tr><td colspan=2><hr></td></tr>
            <tr>
               <td colspan=2><img src="../images/spacer.gif" height="10" style="display:block">Individual customers (or purchasing companies) can also generate retailer-specific (or wholesaler-specific) coupon codes that they can use at checkout counter of participating stores, restaurants and services.<br><br>
           
            &nbsp;But it does not end there.&nbsp;These customers can refer others to specific stores or services by sending a Rewards2Connect generated URL, and when those referred use such URL to generate a coupon code, then the customer who originally referred them also gets a fraction of the amount the referred customer(s) spend using such coupon code.<br><br>
           
