<hr>
<br>
<table>
   <tr><td>So it's like a chain-reaction: you register and refer to other users.&nbsp;If any of them registers and generates coupon codes, you get extra rewards/cash back, and you also get a portion of rewards/cash back from finance charges and/or retail transactions of your referred users' referrals who sign up.</td></tr>

   <tr><td colspan=2><img src="../images/spacer.gif" height="10" style="display:block"><b>But there are some rules that apply:<br>
   &bull;&nbsp;Only a registered user at Rewards2Connect.com can refer others.<br>
   &bull;&nbsp;One cannot refer an already registered Rewards2Connect.com user.<br><br>
   
   So it is CRITICAL to quickly refer as many of your friends and relatives as possible, before they register as a user and refer you.</b><br><br>
   
   Again each of those you refer can refer others and they get a chunk if those they referred register.&nbsp;So it is a world-wide "chain reaction", but you need to be quick!</td></tr>

   <tr><td colspan=2><img src="../images/spacer.gif" height="10" style="display:block">As a further example, you refer a friend or relative and once he/she registers, you get a chunk from his/her activity at Rewards2Connect.com.&nbsp; Once he/she signs up at Rewards2Connect.com, you cannot refer him/her anymore.&nbsp;So it works to your advantage to just refer whoever you know ASAP and you have absolutely NOTHING to lose!!</td></tr>

   <tr><td colspan=2><img src="../images/spacer.gif" height="10" style="display:block">Now, why would you ever pay credit card balances or buy at retail stores / restaurants / grocery stores / other retailers in any other way when you can get a fraction of the bank's profits or your referrals' purchases too?&nbsp; You have absolutely NOTHING to lose because everything is 100% FREE!!</td></tr>
</table>


